      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The borough’s rugged volcanic landscape includes peaks like Cuautzin, which rises to 3,510 meters, part of the Trans-Mexican Volcanic Belt.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
