      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Milpa_Alta",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In San Pablo Oztotepec, Milpa Alta houses the Zapatista Headquarters Museum, where Emiliano Zapata ratified the Plan of Ayala in 1914.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11,
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
