        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://mexicocity.cdmx.gob.mx/locations/milpa-alta/?lang=en",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Milpa Alta is Mexico City’s least populated yet second largest borough, covering 268.6 km² of forest, farmland, and grazing land.",
